<title>SPAIN: Spain's Endesa H1 group net profit down 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Endesa H1 group net profit down 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results for first half 1997 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit				78.59    down 3.9 pct</p>
<p> Cash flow				233.75    up 46.2 pct</p>
<p> Operating incoming		   620.91    up 46.5 pct</p>
<p> Operating result		     158.06    up 10.5 pct</p>
<p> Operating costs			462.85    up 64.8 pct</p>
</text>
